<title>USA: CorVel expands stock buyback plan.</title>
<headline>CorVel expands stock buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>CorVel Corp said Monday it approved a 300,000 share expansion to its existing stock repurchase plan.</p>
<p>Since it started a stock buyback program last fall, CorVel has bought back about 536,000 common shares, or 11.5 percent of its outstanding stock. The expansion announced Monday will bring to 850,000 shares the total number of shares approved for repurchase.</p>
<p>The company said it will consider repurchasing shares at times when its cash balance exceeds internal needs.</p>
</text>
